<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#102d4a"><title>Sign in · Tuka Meta Hackathon</title><style>:root{font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:#102737;background:#eef4f8}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}.card{width:min(440px,100%);background:#fff;border:1px solid #d8e4ed;border-radius:24px;padding:34px;box-shadow:0 18px 70px #102d4a1c}.mark{font-size:35px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:-2px;color:#0758ca}.kicker{display:block;margin-top:35px;color:#0758ca;font-size:10px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:1.5px}.card h1{font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-.7px;margin:8px 0}.intro{color:#64798a;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 24px}.field{display:block;margin:14px 0;color:#456073;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.field input{display:block;width:100%;margin-top:7px;border:1px solid #cddce7;border-radius:11px;padding:13px;background:#f8fbfd;color:#102737;font:inherit;font-size:15px}.field input:focus{outline:3px solid #b7d7ff;border-color:#0758ca}.submit{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:11px;background:#0758ca;color:#fff;padding:14px;font:inherit;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px}.error{min-height:20px;color:#a2333b;font-size:13px;margin:8px 0}.fine{font-size:11px;color:#78909f;line-height:1.5;margin-top:24px}body.dark{background:#0b1d2d;color:#eef6fd}.dark .card{background:#142b3f;border-color:#29435a}.dark .intro,.dark .fine{color:#a6b8c8}.dark .field{color:#c1d2df}.dark .field input{background:#0e2335;border-color:#36536a;color:#eef6fd}</style></head><body><main class="card"><div class="mark">tuka<span style="color:#0758ca">.</span></div><span class="kicker">META HACKATHON BUILD</span><h1>Sign in to the judging build</h1><p class="intro">Use the credentials shared with the judging team. This access protects the live demo and its Meta Copilot token.</p><form action="/auth/login" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="next" value="__NEXT__"><label class="field">Username<input name="username" autocomplete="username" required autofocus></label><label class="field">Password<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required></label><p class="error">{{ERROR}}</p><button class="submit" type="submit">Sign in</button></form><p class="fine">Tuka transit data and AI answers are for demonstration. Confirm live departures in the planner.</p></main></body></html>
